{"page":95,"width":1994,"height":2880,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"2.53 실습 문제 5: 힘을 이용한 데이터 리스트 병합","words":[{"text":"2.53","x":253,"y":200,"width":121,"height":44},{"text":"실습","x":406,"y":193,"width":96,"height":55},{"text":"문제","x":518,"y":194,"width":92,"height":54},{"text":"5:","x":629,"y":198,"width":43,"height":46},{"text":"힘을","x":694,"y":193,"width":92,"height":55},{"text":"이용한","x":805,"y":196,"width":140,"height":55},{"text":"데이터","x":964,"y":195,"width":132,"height":55},{"text":"리스트","x":1120,"y":195,"width":139,"height":54},{"text":"병합","x":1279,"y":196,"width":93,"height":54}]},{"text":"유전자 관련 생명의학 응용 프로그램에서 대용량 데이터셋을 처리하는 경우를 기쩡해보겠습니다.","words":[{"text":"유전자","x":251,"y":333,"width":113,"height":43},{"text":"관련","x":375,"y":333,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"생명의학","x":464,"y":333,"width":150,"height":42},{"text":"응용","x":624,"y":333,"width":75,"height":42},{"text":"프로그램에서","x":711,"y":335,"width":216,"height":41},{"text":"대용량","x":946,"y":334,"width":109,"height":42},{"text":"데이터셋을","x":1068,"y":334,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"처리하는","x":1265,"y":334,"width":148,"height":42},{"text":"경우를","x":1428,"y":332,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"기쩡해보겠습니다.","x":1555,"y":331,"width":309,"height":43}]},{"text":"유사성을 계산하려면 정렬된 DNA 순위가 필요합니다. 그러나 데이터셋이 너무 방대하기 때문에","words":[{"text":"유사성을","x":250,"y":413,"width":151,"height":43},{"text":"계산하려면","x":416,"y":413,"width":182,"height":42},{"text":"정렬된","x":614,"y":413,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"DNA","x":736,"y":419,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"순위가","x":839,"y":413,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"필요합니다.","x":965,"y":413,"width":189,"height":42},{"text":"그러나","x":1173,"y":412,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"데이터셋이","x":1299,"y":410,"width":182,"height":43},{"text":"너무","x":1502,"y":410,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"방대하기","x":1592,"y":409,"width":149,"height":42},{"text":"때문에","x":1761,"y":410,"width":104,"height":44}]},{"text":"단일 머신에서 처리할 수 없습니다. 그러므로 분산 클러스터에서 데이터를 처리하고 저장하며, 각","words":[{"text":"단일","x":250,"y":493,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"머신에서","x":339,"y":492,"width":144,"height":42},{"text":"처리할","x":501,"y":492,"width":111,"height":42},{"text":"수","x":622,"y":492,"width":38,"height":41},{"text":"없습니다.","x":675,"y":491,"width":151,"height":42},{"text":"그러므로","x":844,"y":491,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"분산","x":1002,"y":491,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"클러스터에서","x":1088,"y":489,"width":217,"height":42},{"text":"데이터를","x":1324,"y":488,"width":150,"height":43},{"text":"처리하고","x":1488,"y":488,"width":154,"height":41},{"text":"저장하며,","x":1657,"y":487,"width":157,"height":43},{"text":"각","x":1832,"y":490,"width":37,"height":40}]},{"text":"각의 노드는 일련의 정렬된 값이 있습니다. 주 처리 엔진은 이들 데이터를 모아서 정릴된 단일 스","words":[{"text":"각의","x":249,"y":573,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"노드는","x":337,"y":574,"width":114,"height":38},{"text":"일련의","x":467,"y":571,"width":104,"height":41},{"text":"정렬된","x":590,"y":570,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"값이","x":712,"y":570,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"있습니다.","x":800,"y":570,"width":151,"height":41},{"text":"주","x":969,"y":572,"width":39,"height":39},{"text":"처리","x":1022,"y":569,"width":67,"height":41},{"text":"엔진은","x":1108,"y":568,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"이들","x":1232,"y":568,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"데이터를","x":1320,"y":567,"width":150,"height":42},{"text":"모아서","x":1483,"y":567,"width":112,"height":41},{"text":"정릴된","x":1616,"y":566,"width":112,"height":41},{"text":"단일","x":1744,"y":566,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"스","x":1832,"y":570,"width":35,"height":33}]},{"text":"트림으로 변환해야 합니다. 그러므로 다수의 정렬된 배열을 합쳐서 하나의 정릴된 배열을 만드는","words":[{"text":"트림으로","x":247,"y":652,"width":152,"height":39},{"text":"변환해야","x":414,"y":651,"width":148,"height":41},{"text":"합니다.","x":574,"y":649,"width":118,"height":42},{"text":"그러므로","x":710,"y":649,"width":147,"height":41},{"text":"다수의","x":871,"y":648,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"정렬된","x":995,"y":647,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"배열을","x":1118,"y":646,"width":110,"height":42},{"text":"합쳐서","x":1241,"y":647,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"하나의","x":1368,"y":646,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"정릴된","x":1497,"y":646,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"배열을","x":1628,"y":645,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"만드는","x":1758,"y":645,"width":109,"height":43}]},{"text":"기능이 필요합니다. 이제 벡터를 이용하여 이러한 상횡을 시뮬레이션하는 프로그램을 작성하기","words":[{"text":"기능이","x":248,"y":731,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"필요합니다.","x":378,"y":730,"width":193,"height":41},{"text":"이제","x":595,"y":729,"width":68,"height":41},{"text":"벡터를","x":683,"y":728,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"이용하여","x":811,"y":728,"width":140,"height":41},{"text":"이러한","x":973,"y":726,"width":108,"height":43},{"text":"상횡을","x":1096,"y":725,"width":112,"height":42},{"text":"시뮬레이션하는","x":1225,"y":725,"width":265,"height":42},{"text":"프로그램을","x":1506,"y":724,"width":195,"height":41},{"text":"작성하기","x":1718,"y":724,"width":143,"height":44}]},{"text":"바랍니다.","words":[{"text":"바랍니다.","x":246,"y":809,"width":160,"height":41}]},{"text":"실습 문제를 해결하기 위해 다음 단계를 따라하세요.","words":[{"text":"실습","x":247,"y":908,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"문제를","x":334,"y":909,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"해결하기","x":460,"y":907,"width":142,"height":42},{"text":"위해","x":620,"y":907,"width":69,"height":41},{"text":"다음","x":705,"y":907,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"단계를","x":789,"y":906,"width":110,"height":42},{"text":"따라하세요.","x":911,"y":905,"width":189,"height":43}]},{"text":"1. 각각의 리스트는 이미 정렬되어 있기 때문에 각 리스트의 최소 원소는 맨 앞에 위치합니다.","words":[{"text":"1.","x":272,"y":1025,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"각각의","x":317,"y":1019,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"리스트는","x":448,"y":1019,"width":146,"height":41},{"text":"이미","x":610,"y":1018,"width":68,"height":42},{"text":"정렬되어","x":699,"y":1018,"width":140,"height":43},{"text":"있기","x":862,"y":1018,"width":65,"height":43},{"text":"때문에","x":949,"y":1018,"width":105,"height":43},{"text":"각","x":1074,"y":1018,"width":37,"height":41},{"text":"리스트의","x":1128,"y":1016,"width":142,"height":42},{"text":"최소","x":1291,"y":1016,"width":75,"height":42},{"text":"원소는","x":1384,"y":1016,"width":114,"height":40},{"text":"맨","x":1515,"y":1016,"width":37,"height":40},{"text":"앞에","x":1571,"y":1016,"width":73,"height":40},{"text":"위치합니다.","x":1666,"y":1015,"width":194,"height":42}]},{"text":"이들 원소로부터 최솟값을 빠르게 선택하기 위해 힘을 사공할 것입니다.","words":[{"text":"이들","x":319,"y":1099,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"원소로부터","x":405,"y":1099,"width":179,"height":42},{"text":"최솟값을","x":602,"y":1099,"width":146,"height":42},{"text":"빠르게","x":759,"y":1099,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"선택하기","x":881,"y":1099,"width":140,"height":42},{"text":"위해","x":1040,"y":1098,"width":69,"height":42},{"text":"힘을","x":1124,"y":1097,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"사공할","x":1209,"y":1097,"width":114,"height":41},{"text":"것입니다.","x":1337,"y":1096,"width":158,"height":42}]},{"text":"2. 힘에서 최소 원소를 가져온 후 이를 제거하고, 최소 원소가 있던 리스트에서 그다음으로 작은","words":[{"text":"2.","x":270,"y":1203,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"힘에서","x":318,"y":1198,"width":107,"height":42},{"text":"최소","x":444,"y":1199,"width":74,"height":41},{"text":"원소를","x":531,"y":1199,"width":110,"height":41},{"text":"가져온","x":654,"y":1199,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"후","x":773,"y":1199,"width":39,"height":41},{"text":"이를","x":825,"y":1198,"width":73,"height":42},{"text":"제거하고,","x":910,"y":1199,"width":153,"height":41},{"text":"최소","x":1082,"y":1197,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"원소가","x":1169,"y":1196,"width":113,"height":42},{"text":"있던","x":1296,"y":1197,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"리스트에서","x":1385,"y":1196,"width":184,"height":43},{"text":"그다음으로","x":1587,"y":1196,"width":193,"height":41},{"text":"작은","x":1793,"y":1195,"width":73,"height":41}]},{"text":"원소를 선택해 힘에 추가합니다.","words":[{"text":"원소를","x":318,"y":1278,"width":113,"height":42},{"text":"선택해","x":443,"y":1280,"width":108,"height":42},{"text":"힘에","x":566,"y":1280,"width":70,"height":41},{"text":"추가합니다.","x":650,"y":1279,"width":190,"height":42}]},{"text":"3. 힘의 노드는 이 원소를 어느 리스트에서 가져왔는지, 또한 해당 리스트에서 몇 번째 원소인지","words":[{"text":"3.","x":271,"y":1383,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"힘의","x":318,"y":1378,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"노드는","x":405,"y":1381,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":533,"y":1379,"width":30,"height":41},{"text":"원소를","x":582,"y":1379,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"어느","x":704,"y":1378,"width":71,"height":42},{"text":"리스트에서","x":790,"y":1378,"width":174,"height":41},{"text":"가져왔는지,","x":982,"y":1376,"width":192,"height":43},{"text":"또한","x":1192,"y":1376,"width":77,"height":40},{"text":"해당","x":1281,"y":1377,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"리스트에서","x":1373,"y":1376,"width":182,"height":42},{"text":"몇","x":1576,"y":1376,"width":34,"height":41},{"text":"번째","x":1628,"y":1375,"width":71,"height":41},{"text":"원소인지","x":1718,"y":1375,"width":143,"height":41}]},{"text":"를 저장해야 합니다.","words":[{"text":"를","x":317,"y":1459,"width":39,"height":39},{"text":"저장해야","x":369,"y":1459,"width":149,"height":41},{"text":"합니다.","x":528,"y":1458,"width":118,"height":41}]},{"text":"이 알고리즘의 시간 복잡도를 계산해보겠습니다. 리스트가K개 있다면 힘의 크기는 K가 되고, 모","words":[{"text":"이","x":247,"y":1589,"width":32,"height":41},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":297,"y":1589,"width":183,"height":42},{"text":"시간","x":496,"y":1589,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"복잡도를","x":581,"y":1588,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"계산해보겠습니다.","x":739,"y":1587,"width":300,"height":42},{"text":"리스트가K개","x":1060,"y":1587,"width":223,"height":40},{"text":"있다면","x":1303,"y":1587,"width":109,"height":41},{"text":"힘의","x":1427,"y":1587,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"크기는","x":1515,"y":1586,"width":116,"height":41},{"text":"K가","x":1640,"y":1584,"width":76,"height":41},{"text":"되고,","x":1729,"y":1584,"width":83,"height":42},{"text":"모","x":1830,"y":1590,"width":36,"height":28}]},{"text":"든 힙 연산의 시간 복잡도는 o(log K)가 됩니다. 힘을 구성하는 데는 O(K log K)가 소요됩니다.","words":[{"text":"든","x":242,"y":1671,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"힙","x":295,"y":1669,"width":32,"height":40},{"text"